Q: What is the latest version of Kubernetes?

Answer:
As of June 2026, the latest stable version of Kubernetes is v1.36.1. Kubernetes releases new versions regularly, and only the latest three minor versions are officially supported.

Additional Point:
Managed Kubernetes services like Amazon EKS, Azure AKS, and Google GKE may support slightly older versions based on their release cycle.
